<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's bank closes bonds subcription.</title>
<headline>Morocco's bank closes bonds subcription.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's mortgage Credit Hotelier et Immobilier bank closed on Friday subscriptions for 375 million dirhams ($39.4 million) in 15-year debenture bonds at a rate of 10.5 percent, a stockbroker said.</p>
<p>Subscriptions for the bonds consisting of 2,500 bonds worth 150,000 dirhams each, was open from 10 to 27 June 1997.</p>
<p>The tender was closed on Friday but results were not available, the broker said.</p>
<p>One of the 48 listed stocks on the bourse, CIH shares were last traded at 285 dirhams.</p>
<p>($1= 9.4 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
